WEBVTT

00:08:57.568 --> 00:09:00.616
and to be ignoring
all those seemingly urgent emails

00:09:00.616 --> 00:09:02.370
from my bosses

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:05.437
and maybe to be missing
a friend's birthday party.

00:09:05.437 --> 00:09:09.265
But as soon as I get
to a place of real quiet,

00:09:09.265 --> 00:09:11.734
I realize that it's only by going there

00:09:11.734 --> 00:09:15.761
that I'll have anything fresh
or creative or joyful to share

00:09:15.761 --> 00:09:18.267
with my wife or bosses or friends.

00:09:18.267 --> 00:09:19.547
Otherwise, really,

00:09:19.547 --> 00:09:23.067
I'm just foisting on them
my exhaustion or my distractedness,

00:09:23.067 --> 00:09:25.639
which is no blessing at all.

00:09:26.849 --> 00:09:29.317
And so when I was 29,

00:09:29.317 --> 00:09:32.382
I decided to remake my entire life